<title>USA: Sofamor Danek names Griffin CFO.</title>
<headline>Sofamor Danek names Griffin CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sofamor Danek Group Inc, a surgical products manufacturer, said Monday that it named Goerge Griffin its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>In a statement, Sofamor said Griffin, 49 years, will replace Laurence Fiarey.  Fiarey, who has been with the company for six years, was named president of the Americas, Asia, Pacific division.</p>
<p>Griffin was most recently the chief financial officer of Wright Medical Technologies, a maker of prosthetics and surgical tools.</p>
